# Model selection

As of **2026-06-23**:

| Work | Model |
|------|--------|
| Default implementation (features, fixes, refactors, scripts) | **Cursor Auto** |
| Architecture reviews, design critiques, multi-option trade-offs | **Grok 4.6** (temporary preference) |
| Fast / lightweight reviews (quick sanity check, small diff) | A **faster** model (e.g. Auto or a light reasoning model) |

## Notes

- Use Auto unless the user asks for a specific model or the task is an architecture/design review.
- For deep reviews, prefer **Grok 4.6** over the strongest available reasoning model until this preference is changed.
- If the user only needs a **fast review**, use a faster model instead of Grok 4.6.
- If the user names a model in the chat, that override wins for that turn.
